  "name": "toplevel_reaction_system_ref",
  "description": "A top-level reaction_systems.<k> {ref} mount (esm-spec 4.7). All five bindings mount it (see tests/conformance/toplevel_reaction_system_ref/); each asserts that Chem lands with the leaf's two species and one reaction. Before 2026-11-02 TypeScript, Go and Python refused it with mount_form_unsupported, which is where this directory's name comes from.",
